## Dependencias com outros squads

| Dependencia                 | Squad responsavel | Tipo de interacao                            |
|-----------------------------|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| Picker de contatos          | squad-contatos    | consumir `GET /contacts/for-pipeline`        |
| Dashboard stats             | squad-dashboard   | fornecer dados via `Deal` Prisma             |
| Auth, sessao, tenant        | squad-auth        | consumir `auth()`, `apiServer()`             |
| Config de funis na settings | squad-pipeline    | proprio squad (settings-pipeline-stages.tsx)  |
| Tags de deal                | squad-tags        | consumir `DealTag` Prisma                    |

