```

## Arquitetura do Pipeline (resumo)

```
[Browser]
  |
  |-- pipeline/page.tsx (SSR)
  |     |-- apiServer("/pipelines") ---------> PipelinesController.list
  |     |-- apiServer("/pipelines/:id/deals")-> PipelinesService.getPipelineDeals
  |     |-- apiServer("/contacts/for-pipeline")-> ContactsService.listForPipeline
  |
  |-- pipeline-view.tsx (client)
  |     |-- pipeline-board.tsx (@dnd-kit)
  |     |     |-- moveDealStage -> PATCH /deals/:id/stage
  |     |     |-- markDealWon   -> PATCH /deals/:id/won
  |     |     |-- markDealLost  -> PATCH /deals/:id/lost
  |     |
  |     |-- pipeline-new-deal.tsx
  |           |-- createDeal -> POST /deals
  |
  |-- server actions (Next.js)
        |-- pipelines.ts (CRUD funis)
        |-- pipeline-stages.ts (CRUD estagios)
        |-- deals.ts (create, move, won, lost)
```

